cards.question:
Difference array reconstruction

Recover the original array from its difference array, defined as:

```c
diff[0] = arr[0];
diff[i] = arr[i] - arr[i - 1];
```

cards.answer:
```c
arr[0] = diff[0];

for (int i = 1; i < n; i++) {
    arr[i] = arr[i - 1] + diff[i];
}
```

